#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:4
msgid ":index:`File Variables <variables; file>`"
msgstr ":index:`文件变量 <variables; file>`"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:6
msgid "These variables are populated from information found in the audio files themselves, without any special Picard settings."
msgstr "这些变量是从音频文件本身的信息中填充的，没有任何特殊的 Picard 设置。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:10
msgid "Variables that rely on information from the files (e.g.: ``_bitrate``) are only available for use on tracks with attached files, when running scripts manually on files or in the file naming script."
msgstr ""
"依赖于文件信息（例如：``_bitrate``）的变量，仅在附加了文件的音轨上可用，在手"
"动运行脚本时或在文件命名脚本中可用。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:14
msgid "Prior to version 2.5 Picard did not support using file variables in tagging scripts."
msgstr "在 2.5 版本之前，Picard 不支持在标签脚本中使用文件变量。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:16
msgid "**_bitrate**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:18
msgid "Approximate bitrate in kbps."
msgstr "大约比特率（kbps）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:20
msgid "**_bits_per_sample**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:22
msgid "Bits of data per sample."
msgstr "每个样本的数据位数。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:24
msgid "**_channels**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:26
msgid "Number of audio channels in the file."
msgstr "文件中的音频通道数。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:28
msgid "**_dirname**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:30
msgid "The name of the directory containing the file at the point of being loaded into Picard. (*since Picard 1.1*)"
msgstr "文件在加载到 Picard 时的目录名称。 (*自 Picard 1.1*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:32
msgid "**_extension**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:34
msgid "The file's extension. (*since Picard 0.9*)"
msgstr "文件的扩展名。 (*自 Picard 0.9*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:36
msgid "**_filename**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:38
msgid "The name of the file without extension. (*since Picard 1.1*)"
msgstr "不带扩展名的文件名称。 (*自 Picard 1.1*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:40
msgid "**_filepath**"
msgstr "**_filepath**"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:42
msgid "Full path and name of the file. (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr "文件的完整路径和名称。 (*自 Picard 3.0*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:44
msgid "**_file_created_timestamp**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:46
msgid "The file creation timestamp in the form 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS' as reported by the file system. (*since Picard 2.9*)"
msgstr ""
"文件系统报告的文件创建时间戳，格式为 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS'。 (*自 Picard "
"2.9*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:48
msgid "**_file_modified_timestamp**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:50
msgid "The file modification timestamp in the form 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS' as reported by the file system. (*since Picard 2.9*)"
msgstr ""
"文件系统报告的文件修改时间戳，格式为 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS'。 (*自 Picard "
"2.9*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:52
msgid "**_format**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:54
msgid "Media format of the file (e.g.: MPEG-1 Audio)."
msgstr "文件的媒体格式（例如：MPEG-1 Audio）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:56
msgid "**_length**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:58
msgid "The length of the track in format mins:secs."
msgstr "音轨的长度，格式为 mins:secs。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:60
msgid "**_sample_rate**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:62
msgid "Number of digitizing samples per second (Hz)."
msgstr "每秒数字化样本数（Hz）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:64
msgid "**_filesize**"
msgstr "**_filesize**"

#: ../../variables/variables_file.rst:66
msgid "Size of the file in bytes. (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr "文件的大小（字节）。 (*自 Picard 3.0*)"
